{"title":"Bones","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Baby Red Dragon, Werewolf, Young Red Dragon, Skeleton, Bear +2 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"red-dragon\" title=\"Embermaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embermaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dire-wolf\" title=\"Dire Wolf - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dire Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"baby-red-dragon\" title=\"Baby Red Dragon - dropped it in 49 of 1,068 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7aca051983df137719ab.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Baby Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 12 of 264 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1–2</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton - dropped it in 1 of 35 looted corpses (1/35)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/35<br>×2</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bear\" title=\"Bear - dropped it in 1 of 43 looted corpses (1/43)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ea4940d5e77a776b717.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/43<br>×2</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 15 of 3,494 looted corpses (1/233)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/233<br>×1–2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bones\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"Bones\"></div><h3>Bones</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>7 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 5:18:15 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}